Misho's word (9 Oct 06:25 UTC): asks 17822 / 17823 went out after their goal
was stopped, and only the owner's own stop could cancel an ask. POST
/admin/asks/:askId/cancel now cancels ONE ask that is still „sent": the
reader gets the usual „no longer needed" note in their language and the
conversation is marked done for them — the same step a stopped goal runs,
now shared (letTheReaderOff). 200 {cancelled: false} when the ask was not
sent; nothing is written then. Logged.

